]]></description>
				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Famous American gossip columnist, <a href="http://www.newyorksocialdiary.com/guest-diary/2015/liz-smith-living-for-love" target="_blank">Liz Smith</a>, talked to <strong>Liz Rosenberg</strong> who reveled some very interesting details about <strong>Madonna</strong>&#8216;s <strong>Living For Love</strong> video:<br />
Check it out:</p>
<blockquote class="twitter-tweet" width="550"><p>My friend Liz Rosenberg who reps Madonna said M just shot a video for the 1st single of ‘Rebel Heart’.It’s &#39;Living for Love&#39; -shot Brooklyn.</p>
<p>&mdash; Liz Smith (@LizSmth) <a href="https://twitter.com/LizSmth/status/558653485995270144">January 23, 2015</a></p></blockquote>
<p><script async src="//platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"></script></p>
<blockquote class="twitter-tweet" width="550"><p>Liz Rosenberg said about the Madonna video shoot &#8211; &quot;Lots of gorgeous men &amp; incredible dancing &amp; she looked very sexy.&quot;</p>
<p>&mdash; Liz Smith (@LizSmth) <a href="https://twitter.com/LizSmth/status/558661087881859074">January 23, 2015</a></p></blockquote>
<p><script async src="//platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"></script></p>
<blockquote class="twitter-tweet" width="550"><p>Additionally, L. Rosenberg said of the Madonna video shoot &#8211; &quot;But I think the most important thing was how much fun she was having!”</p>
<p>&mdash; Liz Smith (@LizSmth) <a href="https://twitter.com/LizSmth/status/558661704805277696">January 23, 2015</a></p></blockquote>
<p><script async src="//platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"></script></p>
<p>Liz Smith adds that <em><strong>Madonna</strong> needs more fun. Really. The woman never relaxes!</em><br />
and that <em><strong>Living for Love</strong> will be released February 12th. The album lands in March.</em></p>
<p>Can&#8217;t wait! And you?</p>
