				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>According to Universal Music Germany <strong>Rebel Heart</strong> will be released on <strong>March 6th</strong> in Germany, the same as <a href="http://drownedmadonna.com/madonnas-rebel-heart-will-released-australia-march-6/20150122" target="_blank">Australia</a>.<br />
<a href="http://news.madonnatribe.com/en/2015/rebel-heart-and-living-for-love-european-releases/" target="_blank">MadonnaTribe</a> can reveal that Universal Music Germany plans to release a pyhsical <strong>2-Track CD-Single</strong> for <strong>Living For Love</strong>, and that rumours about touring and performances in German television are not true.<br />
The promotion in Germany will start with interviews to be taped in New York City for German television, with one of the confirmed networks being RTL, <a href="http://drownedmadonna.com/madonna-will-interviewed-french-radio-nrj/20150124" target="_blank">as it will happen next January 30 in France with the interview on NRJ</a>.</p>
